   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Trying to leave the apartment unnoticed, Victoria awkwardly bumps into Nastya in the hallway outside the bathroom. Surprised to see her boss there, Nastya asks whether Victoria and Max are together, creating an uncomfortable and amusing encounter. Let's listen to their conversation in Russian.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
